# Lead delivery. GoHighLevel is the primary record AND the notification —
# a workflow on the "website lead" tag is what tells the owner a lead came in.
# There is no transactional email service; nothing here sends mail directly.

# Google Sheet + Gmail lead pipeline (docs/GOOGLE-SHEET-SETUP.md).
# The Apps Script web app URL that appends each lead to the "Ascent Leads"
# sheet and emails the owner. Leads still work without it; failures only log.
LEADS_WEBHOOK_URL=
# Must match the SECRET constant pasted into the Apps Script.
LEADS_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# GoHighLevel (docs/GOHIGHLEVEL-SETUP.md). Set these: without them nothing
# reaches the CRM and no notification fires. A prospect is never blocked
# either way — failures only log, and a qualified one still gets the calendar.
# Private Integration token (Settings > Private Integrations), starts with "pit-".
GHL_API_TOKEN=
# Settings > Business Profile > Location ID.
GHL_LOCATION_ID=
# Optional: a workflow's Inbound Webhook URL, if you'd rather map fields there.
GHL_WEBHOOK_URL=
